1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,500
I can't just let this slide.

2
00:00:03,163 --> 00:00:06,163
I'm filing a formal complaint
with the Monolith Order right now!

3
00:00:10,607 --> 00:00:12,107
N-No...

4
00:00:15,457 --> 00:00:18,457
No! No! No! No! No! No!

5
00:00:19,335 --> 00:00:22,835
If the Order finds out, I might lose
my position as a Saintess!

6
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:26,440
P-Please, don't worry so much,
Muriel!

7
00:00:26,561 --> 00:00:28,961
The Grand Master is... a merciful person...

8
00:00:29,062 --> 00:00:31,562
She might forgive you with just
a demotion to rank 200 or so.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,800
Rank 200?! That's basically just a maid!

